---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: We turn things on
description: Ivanhoe and Eaglemont home technology support for Mesh Wi-Fi, smart security, home offices and everyday tech problems.
---

<!-- Hero Section -->
<header class="relative pt-32 pb-20 lg:pt-48 lg:pb-32 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        
        <!-- Text Content -->
        <div class="z-10 order-2 lg:order-1 text-center lg:text-left">
            <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-7xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-tight mb-6">
                We turn <br>
                <span class="text-electric-peach-ink">things on.</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="text-lg lg:text-xl text-ivanhoe-slate/80 mb-8 max-w-md mx-auto lg:mx-0 leading-relaxed">
                Ivanhoe’s most attractive IT support. Full transparency. No hidden fees. Just pure performance.
            </p>
            <div class="flex justify-center lg:justify-start">
                <a href="/services/" class="inline-flex min-h-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ivanhoe-slate px-10 py-4 text-lg font-bold text-skin-bone shadow-xl transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-gray-800">
                EXPLORE SERVICES</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Image/Visual -->
        <div class="order-1 lg:order-2 relative group">
            <div class="absolute -inset-1 bg-electric-peach rounded-2xl blur opacity-20 group-hover:opacity-40 transition duration-1000"></div>
            <img
                src="/img/nakedtech_hero_technician.webp"
                alt="Naked Tech Technician in a sun-drenched living room"
                width="1408"
                height="768"
                class="relative rounded-2xl shadow-2xl object-cover h-64 w-full lg:h-[500px]"
            >
        </div>
    </div>
</header>

<!-- The Hook Section -->
<section class="py-24 bg-white/50">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-3xl text-center">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6">Size Matters.</h2>
        <p class="text-xl text-ivanhoe-slate/80 leading-relaxed">
            Tired of weak signals in the bedroom? Does your connection drop out when things are getting good? 
            <span class="font-semibold text-ivanhoe-slate">Naked Tech</span> is here to satisfy your need for speed. 
            We service Ivanhoe and Eaglemont.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Service Grid -->
<section class="py-24">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="text-center mb-16">
            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold">We handle your hardware with care.</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4">
            {% for service in services %}
            <article class="flex h-full flex-col rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl md:p-8">
                <div class="mb-6 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-skin-bone text-electric-peach" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="{{ service.iconPath }}"></path></svg>
                </div>
                <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-electric-peach-ink">{{ service.category }}</p>
                <h3 class="mt-2 text-xl font-bold">{{ service.name }}</h3>
                <p class="mt-3 flex-grow leading-relaxed text-gray-600">{{ service.cardDescription }}</p>
                <a href="/services/{{ service.slug }}/" class="mt-5 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center font-bold text-ivanhoe-slate hover:text-electric-peach hover:underline">
                    See the full service <span class="ml-2" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
                </a>
            </article>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- The Promise -->
<section class="py-24 bg-ivanhoe-slate text-skin-bone">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
            <h2 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold mb-6">Total Transparency.</h2>
            <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-electric-peach mb-6"></div>
        </div>
        <div>
            <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed opacity-90">
                We believe in showing you everything. Our pricing is stripped down—what you see is what you pay. 
                Our technicians are open, honest, and easy on the eyes.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>